00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.330
because that was in
the last session--

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:00.215
was Philips Healthcare, where
their techs had a ton of data,

00:24:00.215 --> 00:24:02.090
but they didn't know
how to bring it together

00:24:02.090 --> 00:24:05.240
in order to do repairs
