drinks I had, to be honest.

00:29:21.770 --> 00:29:22.290
BRYAN KOKISH: Wait, wait, wait.

00:29:22.290 --> 00:29:22.400
Wait.

00:29:22.400 --> 00:29:23.550
What did you say, three to five?

00:29:23.550 --> 00:29:24.470
JOSE PAGAN: Three to five
years away from a Super Bowl.

00:29:24.470 --> 00:29:25.370
I'm going to stand by that.

00:29:25.370 --> 00:29:26.050
BRYAN KOKISH: How
about one to two?

00:29:26.050 --> 00:29:27.840
JOSE PAGAN: Going to
radio sports talk.

00:29:27.840 --> 00:29:28.960
BRYAN KOKISH: One
other last plug.

00:29:28.960 --> 00:29:30.440
Actually, a lot
of companies talk

00:29:30.440 --> 00:29:32.430
