individuals across the planet.

00:30:18.890 --> 00:30:20.280
And I'm pretty
sure, saying that.

00:30:20.280 --> 00:30:21.080
There's not even a joke there.

00:30:21.080 --> 00:30:21.900
That's just fact.

00:30:21.900 --> 00:30:23.250
BRYAN KOKISH: I think that's
why we're all there, too.

00:30:23.250 --> 00:30:23.540
JOSE PAGAN: Absolutely.

00:30:23.540 --> 00:30:24.350
BRYAN KOKISH: I mean,
we're really proud of that.

00:30:24.350 --> 00:30:25.910
JOSE PAGAN: Yeah, it
definitely pushes you forward

00:30:25.910 --> 00:30:26.567
